  "description": "When seeking a safe and comfortable electric scooter for your teen's first riding experience, the Hiboy S2 Lite stands out with its exceptional performance. Its vibrant design and sleek style make commuting enjoyable and help your kids stand out in crowds. Available in pink and black, the Hiboy S2 Lite caters to different preferences.\nEquipped with a 36V 5Ah battery, it offers a maximum range of 10.6 miles and a top speed of 13 mph. The scooter fully charges in just 3.5 to 4.5 hours, ensuring quick preparation for the next ride. Its 6.5-inch solid tires provide a smooth journey.\nThe Hiboy S2 Lite features dual brakes, including an ABS E-brake and a rear pedal brake, for enhanced control and stopping power. This lightweight scooter combines geometric design frames, components, and accessories in a simple yet elegant package. With its colorful blend and suitable size, the Hiboy S2 Lite delivers style, safety, and an exciting riding experience for your kids.\nAdditionally, the Hiboy S2 Lite is equipped with a headlight on the stem, providing excellent illumination for safer night riding. This electric scooter excels in performance while reflecting thoughtful consideration for safety and convenience in its details. Choose the Hiboy S2 Lite for a safe and stylish riding experience for your teens/ kids.",
